# Do NOT rewrite line endings -- DA-20260914-100937222-656f
#
# The repository mirrors the built package. If git turns LF into CRLF on
# checkout, the working tree drifts from the package, and repo_spiegeln.ps1
# reported changes on every run that nobody had written. Same reasoning as
# for version.txt in paket_bauen.ps1: building must not alter the state it
# is building from.
#
# esel.ico is binary and has no business being touched here anyway.
* -text
*.ico binary
